---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="About">
  <article>
    <h1>About</h1>

    <div class="notice" style="border-left:4px solid #e4e8ea;padding:0.5rem 1.1rem;margin:1.25rem 0;">
      <h4>It does not matter how slowly you go as long as you do not stop.</h4>
      <cite>~Confucius</cite>
    </div>

    <div class="prose">
      <p>
        I am not sure what I should write here. This is a personal site where I noted
        down things that interests me. It could be anything or everything I learn from
        my humble experiences.
      </p>
      <p>
        Writing was one of my interests too, especially if it is about stories and
        memories that I have made over the years. Regardless it was a good time or a bad
        time, I surely have learned something.
      </p>
      <p>
        Finally, growth to me is not about the age, it is rather the colorful experiences
        that garnered over our lifetime. Have fun!
      </p>
      <p>
        <img src="/assets/images/hippo-enjoying-day.gif" alt="Hippo enjoying the day" />
      </p>
    </div>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
